# Portfolio at a glance

kpi Total balances | $1,639M | 4 loan types | neutral
kpi Delinquency (30+ days) | 1.4% | +0.1 pts from 1.3% in Q2 | bad
kpi Charge-offs | $3.9M | up from $3.1M in Q2 | bad
